# A picture and a file waiting in the composer, its words taken out (MBUI_FIXTURE=chat-attach), sent on a phone: the
# row comes in where it is, the picture and the card flying into it, the composer as it was till they let go of it.
timeout 20000
wait 1500
tapxy 120 -150
wait 400
clear
wait 600
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1800
exit
